OL,3,GNEWSANHS and school staff to get
OL,4,Adiscounted bus travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople working at schools or NHS sites
OL,7,Fin Oxford will get discounted travel
OL,8,Ffrom the city's park and rides in a bid
OL,9,Fto reduce congestion.
OL,11,FMoney collected from the city's
OL,12,Ftemporary congestion charge will fund
OL,13,F16 hours free parking each day at
OL,14,FOxford's five park and ride sites, as
OL,15,Fwell as subsidised #1 single bus
OL,16,Ftickets.
OL,18,FOxfordshire County Council currently
OL,19,Foffers a subsidised #3 combined ticket
OL,20,Ffor up to five people.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
